uild=all linker=mold platform=linuxbsd target=template_release optimize=speed disable_path_overrides=no\r\n\r\n$ hyperfine -iw1 \"ccache -C && vstask clean && vstask template\" && gh pr checkout 115732 && git rebase master --no-gpg-sign && hyperfine -iw1 \"ccache -C && vstask clean && vstask template\"\r\n\r\nBenchmark 1: ccache -C && vstask clean && vstask template\r\n  Time (mean ± σ):     108.804 s ±  0.143 s    [User: 2417.601 s, System: 121.390 s]\r\n  Range (min … max):   108.661 s … 109.100 s    10 runs\r\n \r\nremote: Enumerating objects: 42, done.\r\nremote: Counting objects: 100% (17/17), done.\r\nremote: Compressing objects: 100% (10/10), done.\r\nremote: Total 42 (delta 9), reused 7 (delta 7), pack-reused 25 (from 1)\r\nUnpacking objects: 100% (42/42), 197.85 KiB | 2.13 MiB/s, done.\r\nFrom https://github.com/godotengine/godot\r\n * [new ref]               refs/pull/115732/head -> scene-main-debugger-includes\r\nSwitched to branch 'scene-main-debugger-includes'\r\nCurrent branch scene-main-debugger-includes is up to date.\r\n\r\nBenchmark 1: ccache -C && vstask clean && vstask template\r\n  Time (mean ± σ):     108.842 s ±  0.206 s    [User: 2415.564 s, System: 121.499 s]\r\n  Range (min … max):   108.546 s … 109.196 s    10 runs\r\n```\r\n\r\nNonetheless, it's not causing a regression in build times at least. Maybe someone else can try to benchmark it on their end.\r\n\r\n<details open>\r\n\r\n<summary>PC specifications</summary>\r\n\r\n- **CPU:** AMD Ryzen 9 9950X3D\r\n- **GPU:** NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090\r\n- **RAM:** 64 GB (2×32 GB DDR5-6000 CL30)\r\n- **SSD:** Solidigm P44 Pro 2 TB\r\n- **OS:** Linux (Fedora 43)\r\n</details>","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115732#pullrequestreview-3826999409","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115732","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115732#pullrequestreview-3826999409"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115732"}},"submitted_at":"2026-02-19T16:29:50Z","commit_id":"1c12d2c36e31be87adb600cc148053eda9031b0c"}]